OL,3,GNEWSATown centre balaclava ban bid to
OL,4,Atake step forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to introduce a ban on face
OL,7,Fcoverings in Loughborough town centre
OL,8,Fare set to take a step forward.
OL,10,FCharnwood Borough Council's cabinet is
OL,11,Frecommended to approve proposals on 8
OL,12,FOctober to publish a notice of
OL,13,Fintention to extend and alter the
OL,14,Fcurrent public space protection order
OL,15,F(PSPO) in Loughborough.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
